; Example 5: sub-bit split quantization (radius=3, angle=2)
; After POLAR, quantize radius and angle with different bit widths.
; Angles concentrate around golden-ratio multiples, so fewer bits suffice.
; Compression: (3+2)/2 = 2.5 bits/value vs 3-bit uniform.
LDV V0, [0x00000000]
GVNS V0, 0
GVNS V0, 1
GVNS V0, 2
POLAR V0
SUBBIT_ENC V0, 3, 2
STV V0, [0x10000000]
HALT
